{"seq":1,"slug":"fiber-architecture","title":"Fiber 架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/core-concepts/fiber-architecture","wordCount":868,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"fiber-架构\">Fiber 架构</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Fiber 是 React 16 引入的重写协调引擎，它把渲染工作拆分为可中断的小单元（Fiber Node），从而使长任务不再阻塞主线程。支撑这一能力的是三个相互配合的机制：以 <code>child</code>/<code>sibling</code>/<code>return</code> 指针构成的链表树、可让出主线程的 Work Loop，以及用位运算表达优先级的 Lanes 模型。本章依次讲解 Fiber 的数据结构、两个渲染阶段、优先级模型与双缓冲机制，说明 React 如何在中断与恢复之间保持 UI 一致性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要-fiber\">为什么需要 Fiber</h2><p>React 15 及之前使用递归的 <strong>Stack Reconciler</strong>，一旦开始渲染就无法中断，长任务会阻塞主线程导致掉帧。React 16 引入的 <strong>Fiber 架构</strong> 将渲染工作拆分为可中断的小单元，使 React 能够在空闲时间片内逐步完成更新，从而保持流畅的用户交互。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Stack[&quot;Stack Reconciler (React 15)&quot;]&#10;        S1[开始渲染] --&gt; S2[递归处理整棵树]&#10;        S2 --&gt; S3[完成渲染]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Fiber[&quot;Fiber Reconciler (React 16+)&quot;]&#10;        F1[开始渲染] --&gt; F2[处理一个 Fiber 节点]&#10;        F2 --&gt; F3{时间片用完?}&#10;        F3 -- 否 --&gt; F2&#10;        F3 -- 是 --&gt; F4[让出主线程]&#10;        F4 --&gt; F5[下一帧继续]&#10;        F5 --&gt; F2&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Stack[\"Stack Reconciler (React 15)\"]\n        S1[开始渲染] --&gt; S2[递归处理整棵树]\n        S2 --&gt; S3[完成渲染]\n    end\n    subgraph Fiber[\"Fiber Reconciler (React 16+)\"]\n        F1[开始渲染] --&gt; F2[处理一个 Fiber 节点]\n        F2 --&gt; F3{时间片用完?}\n        F3 -- 否 --&gt; F2\n        F3 -- 是 --&gt; F4[让出主线程]\n        F4 --&gt; F5[下一帧继续]\n        F5 --&gt; F2\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"fiber-node-数据结构\">Fiber Node 数据结构</h2><p>每一个 React 元素对应一个 <strong>Fiber Node</strong>，它是一个 JavaScript 对象，包含了组件类型、状态、副作用等信息。Fiber Node 通过三个指针构成链表树结构：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>指向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>child</code></td>\n<td>第一个子节点</td>\n<td>子 Fiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>sibling</code></td>\n<td>下一个兄弟节点</td>\n<td>兄弟 Fiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>return</code></td>\n<td>父节点</td>\n<td>父 Fiber</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface FiberNode {&#10;  tag: number;&#10;  key: string | null;&#10;  type: any;&#10;  stateNode: any;&#10;&#10;  return: FiberNode | null;&#10;  child: FiberNode | null;&#10;  sibling: FiberNode | null;&#10;&#10;  memoizedState: any;&#10;  memoizedProps: any;&#10;  pendingProps: any;&#10;&#10;  flags: number;&#10;  lanes: number;&#10;  alternate: FiberNode | null;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  tag</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  stateNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  child</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  sibling</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  memoizedState</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  memoizedProps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  pendingProps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  flags</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  lanes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  alternate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    App[&quot;App (return: null)&quot;]&#10;    App --&gt;|child| Header[&quot;Header&quot;]&#10;    Header --&gt;|sibling| Main[&quot;Main&quot;]&#10;    Main --&gt;|sibling| Footer[&quot;Footer&quot;]&#10;    Header --&gt;|return| App&#10;    Main --&gt;|return| App&#10;    Footer --&gt;|return| App&#10;    Main --&gt;|child| List[&quot;List&quot;]&#10;    List --&gt;|return| Main&#10;    List --&gt;|child| Item1[&quot;Item 1&quot;]&#10;    Item1 --&gt;|sibling| Item2[&quot;Item 2&quot;]&#10;    Item1 --&gt;|return| List&#10;    Item2 --&gt;|return| List\">flowchart TD\n    App[\"App (return: null)\"]\n    App --&gt;|child| Header[\"Header\"]\n    Header --&gt;|sibling| Main[\"Main\"]\n    Main --&gt;|sibling| Footer[\"Footer\"]\n    Header --&gt;|return| App\n    Main --&gt;|return| App\n    Footer --&gt;|return| App\n    Main --&gt;|child| List[\"List\"]\n    List --&gt;|return| Main\n    List --&gt;|child| Item1[\"Item 1\"]\n    Item1 --&gt;|sibling| Item2[\"Item 2\"]\n    Item1 --&gt;|return| List\n    Item2 --&gt;|return| List</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Fiber 使用链表而非数组来组织子节点，这使得在任意位置暂停和恢复遍历变得非常高效。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"work-loop-工作循环\">Work Loop 工作循环</h2><p>Fiber 的核心调度逻辑在 <strong>Work Loop</strong> 中。它分为两个阶段：</p>\n<h3 id=\"render-阶段-可中断\">Render 阶段（可中断）</h3><p>Work Loop 通过 <code>performUnitOfWork</code> 逐个处理 Fiber 节点。每个 Fiber 先执行 <code>beginWork</code>（向下递）再执行 <code>completeWork</code>（向上归）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function workLoopConcurrent(): void {&#10;  while (workInProgress !== null &amp;&amp; !shouldYield()) {&#10;    performUnitOfWork(workInProgress);&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;function performUnitOfWork(unitOfWork: FiberNode): void {&#10;  const next = beginWork(unitOfWork);&#10;&#10;  if (next === null) {&#10;    completeUnitOfWork(unitOfWork);&#10;  } else {&#10;    workInProgress = next;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> workLoopConcurrent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (workInProgress </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> !</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shouldYield</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    performUnitOfWork</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(workInProgress);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> performUnitOfWork</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">unitOfWork</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> next</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> beginWork</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(unitOfWork);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (next </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    completeUnitOfWork</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(unitOfWork);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    workInProgress </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> next;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"commit-阶段-不可中断\">Commit 阶段（不可中断）</h3><p>Render 阶段完成后进入 Commit 阶段，将所有变更一次性应用到真实 DOM。此阶段分为三个子阶段：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>子阶段</th>\n<th>时机</th>\n<th>典型操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Before Mutation</td>\n<td>DOM 变更前</td>\n<td><code>getSnapshotBeforeUpdate</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mutation</td>\n<td>DOM 变更中</td>\n<td>插入、更新、删除 DOM 节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Layout</td>\n<td>DOM 变更后</td>\n<td><code>useLayoutEffect</code>、<code>componentDidMount</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    R[Render 阶段] --&gt; BM[Before Mutation]&#10;    BM --&gt; M[Mutation]&#10;    M --&gt; L[Layout]&#10;    L --&gt; P[浏览器绘制]&#10;&#10;    R -.-&gt;|可中断| R&#10;    BM --&gt;|不可中断| M&#10;    M --&gt;|不可中断| L\">flowchart LR\n    R[Render 阶段] --&gt; BM[Before Mutation]\n    BM --&gt; M[Mutation]\n    M --&gt; L[Layout]\n    L --&gt; P[浏览器绘制]\n\n    R -.-&gt;|可中断| R\n    BM --&gt;|不可中断| M\n    M --&gt;|不可中断| L</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"priority-lanes-优先级模型\">Priority Lanes 优先级模型</h2><p>React 18 使用 <strong>Lanes</strong> 模型管理更新优先级。每条 Lane 是一个 32 位整数中的一个或多个位，不同优先级的更新占据不同的位。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"type Lane = number;&#10;type Lanes = number;&#10;&#10;const NoLane: Lane = 0b0000000000000000000000000000000;&#10;const SyncLane: Lane = 0b0000000000000000000000000000010;&#10;const InputContinuousLane: Lane = 0b0000000000000000000000000001000;&#10;const DefaultLane: Lane = 0b0000000000000000000000000100000;&#10;const TransitionLane1: Lane = 0b0000000000000000000001000000000;&#10;const IdleLane: Lane = 0b0100000000000000000000000000000;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Lane</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Lanes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NoLane</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Lane</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0b0000000000000000000000000000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SyncLane</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Lane</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0b0000000000000000000000000000010</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> InputContinuousLane</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Lane</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0b0000000000000000000000000001000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> DefaultLane</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Lane</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0b0000000000000000000000000100000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TransitionLane1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Lane</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0b0000000000000000000001000000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> IdleLane</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Lane</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0b0100000000000000000000000000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优先级</th>\n<th>Lane 类型</th>\n<th>触发场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>SyncLane</td>\n<td><code>flushSync</code>、受控输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>InputContinuousLane</td>\n<td>连续输入事件（拖拽、滚动）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>普通</td>\n<td>DefaultLane</td>\n<td><code>setState</code> 默认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>过渡</td>\n<td>TransitionLane</td>\n<td><code>startTransition</code> 包裹的更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空闲</td>\n<td>IdleLane</td>\n<td><code>useDeferredValue</code> 延迟更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Lanes 用位运算合并和比较优先级，比 React 17 的 <code>expirationTime</code> 模型更灵活，能够表达多个并发优先级。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"双缓冲机制\">双缓冲机制</h2><p>React 维护两棵 Fiber 树：<strong>current</strong> 树对应当前屏幕上的 UI，<strong>workInProgress</strong> 树是正在构建中的新 UI。更新完成后两棵树交换身份。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 屏幕&#10;        C[current 树]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 内存&#10;        W[workInProgress 树]&#10;    end&#10;    C --&gt;|alternate| W&#10;    W --&gt;|alternate| C&#10;    W --&gt;|commit 完成后| C2[变为新的 current]\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 屏幕\n        C[current 树]\n    end\n    subgraph 内存\n        W[workInProgress 树]\n    end\n    C --&gt;|alternate| W\n    W --&gt;|alternate| C\n    W --&gt;|commit 完成后| C2[变为新的 current]</pre><p>每个 Fiber 节点的 <code>alternate</code> 属性指向另一棵树中对应的节点。这种双缓冲策略避免了频繁创建和销毁对象，同时使得回滚变得简单——如果更新被中断，直接丢弃 workInProgress 树即可。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function createWorkInProgress(current: FiberNode, pendingProps: any): FiberNode {&#10;  let workInProgress = current.alternate;&#10;&#10;  if (workInProgress === null) {&#10;    workInProgress = createFiber(current.tag, pendingProps, current.key);&#10;    workInProgress.type = current.type;&#10;    workInProgress.stateNode = current.stateNode;&#10;    workInProgress.alternate = current;&#10;    current.alternate = workInProgress;&#10;  } else {&#10;    workInProgress.pendingProps = pendingProps;&#10;    workInProgress.flags = 0;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  workInProgress.child = current.child;&#10;  workInProgress.memoizedState = current.memoizedState;&#10;  workInProgress.lanes = current.lanes;&#10;&#10;  return workInProgress;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createWorkInProgress</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">current</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pendingProps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> any</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FiberNode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> workInProgress </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.alternate;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (workInProgress </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    workInProgress </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createFiber</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(current.tag, pendingProps, current.key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    workInProgress.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.type;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    workInProgress.stateNode </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.stateNode;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    workInProgress.alternate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    current.alternate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> workInProgress;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    workInProgress.pendingProps </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pendingProps;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    workInProgress.flags </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  workInProgress.child </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.child;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  workInProgress.memoizedState </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.memoizedState;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  workInProgress.lanes </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current.lanes;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> workInProgress;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Fiber Node</strong> 是 React 中对组件实例的内部表示，通过 <code>child</code>、<code>sibling</code>、<code>return</code> 三个指针组成链表树</li>\n<li><strong>Work Loop</strong> 将渲染拆分为可中断的工作单元，每个时间片处理若干个 Fiber 节点</li>\n<li><strong>Render 阶段</strong> 可以被中断和恢复，<strong>Commit 阶段</strong> 必须同步完成</li>\n<li><strong>Lanes 优先级模型</strong> 使用位运算管理多级优先级，支持并发更新</li>\n<li><strong>双缓冲机制</strong> 通过 current / workInProgress 两棵树实现高效更新与安全回滚</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Fiber 架构","id":"fiber-架构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要 Fiber","id":"为什么需要-fiber"},{"level":2,"text":"Fiber Node 数据结构","id":"fiber-node-数据结构"},{"level":2,"text":"Work Loop 工作循环","id":"work-loop-工作循环"},{"level":3,"text":"Render 阶段（可中断）","id":"render-阶段-可中断"},{"level":3,"text":"Commit 阶段（不可中断）","id":"commit-阶段-不可中断"},{"level":2,"text":"Priority Lanes 优先级模型","id":"priority-lanes-优先级模型"},{"level":2,"text":"双缓冲机制","id":"双缓冲机制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"协调算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/core-concepts/reconciliation"}}